    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d39-f1" n="1" xml:id="d39-f1-content">
                <p>In a press release of June 30, the Department announced that the Council would
                    meet in Honolulu the first week of August. For text, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, July 21, 1952, p. 110.</p>
                <p>Simultaneous announcement was made in Canberra and Wellington.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
